== lit claims --help
Reserve issues with expiring work claims

Usage:
  lit claims [flags]
  lit claims [command]

Available Commands:
  acquire     Reserve issues with expiring exclusive claims
  get         Read claims and current properties
  list        List and filter claims
  release     Release claims owned by this session
  renew       Extend claims owned by this session

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for claims

Global Flags:
      --endpoint URL       Optional. Service URL; flag > LIT_ENDPOINT > remembered session > http://127.0.0.1:7411
      --format FORMAT      Optional. Output FORMAT: cli, markdown or json (otherwise session preference)
